# Argon OS — labwc (Wayland) session autostart.
# Paints the Argon wallpaper and starts the panel. Kept deliberately small;
# this is the experimental Wayland option, not the primary desktop.

# Wallpaper (same image as the XFCE desktop), scaled to fill.
swaybg -i /usr/share/backgrounds/argon/argon-default.png -m fill &

# Panel (waybar uses its packaged default config if none is provided).
waybar &

# Network/Bluetooth/volume trays via the XFCE helpers (run under XWayland).
nm-applet --indicator &
blueman-applet &
